{"id": 2, "title": "Day 2", "topic": "The 6 cases", "date": "2026-11-25", "words": [{"id": "d2w1", "kind": "noun", "g": "m", "ru": "брат", "en": "brother", "pic": "boy.png", "audio": "52eed4f175.mp3", "note": "", "pr": "brat", "lemmas": ["брат"]}, {"id": "d2w2", "kind": "noun", "g": "m", "ru": "кот", "en": "cat (male)", "pic": "cat.png", "audio": "0601515e32.mp3", "note": "", "pr": "kot", "lemmas": ["кот"]}, {"id": "d2w3", "kind": "noun", "g": "f", "ru": "сестра́", "en": "sister", "pic": "girl.png", "audio": "876bc80644.mp3", "note": "", "pr": "sist-RA", "lemmas": ["сестра́"]}, {"id": "d2w4", "kind": "noun", "g": "f", "ru": "маши́на", "en": "car", "pic": "automobile.png", "audio": "ee5c4501cc.mp3", "note": "", "pr": "ma-SHI-na", "lemmas": ["маши́на"]}, {"id": "d2w5", "kind": "noun", "g": "n", "ru": "окно́", "en": "window", "pic": "window.png", "audio": "9a86408565.mp3", "note": "", "pr": "ak-NO", "lemmas": ["окно́"]}, {"id": "d2w6", "kind": "noun", "g": "n", "ru": "письмо́", "en": "letter", "pic": "envelope.png", "audio": "7786b8940e.mp3", "note": "", "pr": "pis'-MO", "lemmas": ["письмо́"]}, {"id": "d2w7", "kind": "adj", "g": "adj", "ru": "большо́й", "en": "big", "pic": "elephant.png", "audio": "4680cb4088.mp3", "note": "", "table": {"cols": ["", "form"], "rows": [["masc.", "большо́й"], ["fem.", "больша́я"], ["neut.", "большо́е"], ["plural", "больши́е"]]}, "pr": "bal'-SHOI", "lemmas": ["большо́й"]}, {"id": "d2w8", "kind": "adj", "g": "adj", "ru": "ма́ленький", "en": "small, little", "pic": "mouse.png", "audio": "3688943ae4.mp3", "note": "", "table": {"cols": ["", "form"], "rows": [["masc.", "ма́ленький"], ["fem.", "ма́ленькая"], ["neut.", "ма́ленькое"], ["plural", "ма́ленькие"]]}, "pr": "MA-lin'-kiy", "lemmas": ["ма́ленький"]}, {"id": "d2w9", "kind": "adj", "g": "adj", "ru": "но́вый", "en": "new", "pic": "sparkles.png", "audio": "773344eb6b.mp3", "note": "", "table": {"cols": ["", "form"], "rows": [["masc.", "но́вый"], ["fem.", "но́вая"], ["neut.", "но́вое"], ["plural", "но́вые"]]}, "pr": "NO-vih", "lemmas": ["но́вый"]}, {"id": "d2w10", "kind": "adj", "g": "adj", "ru": "хоро́ший", "en": "good", "pic": "thumbs_up.png", "audio": "48032a8ba8.mp3", "note": "", "table": {"cols": ["", "form"], "rows": [["masc.", "хоро́ший"], ["fem.", "хоро́шая"], ["neut.", "хоро́шее"], ["plural", "хоро́шие"]]}, "pr": "kha-RO-shiy", "lemmas": ["хоро́ший"]}], "sentences": [{"id": "d2s1", "word": "d2w1", "ru": "Э́то мой брат.", "en": "This is my brother.", "pics": ["man.png", "boy.png"], "audio": "342d1ecd8f.mp3", "pr": "E-ta moi brat"}, {"id": "d2s2", "word": "d2w2", "ru": "У нас есть кот.", "en": "We have a cat.", "pics": ["cat.png", "house.png"], "audio": "adbf4e5bd5.mp3", "pr": "u nas yest' kot"}, {"id": "d2s3", "word": "d2w3", "ru": "Моя́ сестра́ чита́ет.", "en": "My sister is reading.", "pics": ["girl.png", "open_book.png"], "audio": "e2621c91c2.mp3", "pr": "ma-YA sist-RA chi-TA-yet"}, {"id": "d2s4", "word": "d2w4", "ru": "Э́то но́вая маши́на.", "en": "This is a new car.", "pics": ["automobile.png", "sparkles.png"], "audio": "2bb2f92c24.mp3", "pr": "E-ta NO-va-ya ma-SHI-na"}, {"id": "d2s5", "word": "d2w5", "ru": "Окно́ большо́е.", "en": "The window is big.", "pics": ["window.png"], "audio": "bd2dde2ac1.mp3", "pr": "ak-NO bal'-SHO-ye"}, {"id": "d2s6", "word": "d2w6", "ru": "Я пишу́ письмо́ бра́ту.", "en": "I'm writing a letter to my brother.", "pics": ["envelope.png", "boy.png"], "audio": "bcf6fb018d.mp3", "pr": "ya pi-SHU pis'-MO BRA-tu"}, {"id": "d2s7", "word": "d2w7", "ru": "Э́то большо́й дом.", "en": "This is a big house.", "pics": ["elephant.png", "house.png"], "audio": "75e818f419.mp3", "pr": "E-ta bal'-SHOI dom"}, {"id": "d2s8", "word": "d2w8", "ru": "Э́то ма́ленький дом.", "en": "This is a small house.", "pics": ["mouse.png", "house.png"], "audio": "0dfa14c01c.mp3", "pr": "E-ta MA-lin'-kiy dom"}, {"id": "d2s9", "word": "d2w9", "ru": "У меня́ но́вый телефо́н.", "en": "I have a new phone.", "pics": ["mobile_phone.png", "sparkles.png"], "audio": "fceace803e.mp3", "pr": "u mi-NYA NO-vih ti-li-FON"}, {"id": "d2s10", "word": "d2w10", "ru": "Он хоро́ший друг.", "en": "He is a good friend.", "pics": ["thumbs_up.png", "people_hugging.png"], "audio": "69ca38f4db.mp3", "pr": "on kha-RO-shiy druk"}, {"id": "d2s11", "word": null, "ru": "Хоро́ший друг звони́т.", "mk": "{Хоро́ш|ий} {друг} звони́т.", "g": "m", "case": "Nominative", "en": "A good friend is calling.", "pics": ["people_hugging.png", "mobile_phone.png"], "audio": "e925f6de19.mp3", "pr": "kha-RO-shiy druk zva-NIT"}, {"id": "d2s12", "word": null, "ru": "Здесь но́вая маши́на.", "mk": "Здесь {но́в|ая} {маши́н|а}.", "g": "f", "case": "Nominative", "en": "Here is a new car.", "pics": ["automobile.png", "sparkles.png"], "audio": "b73c2bae2c.mp3", "pr": "zdyes' NO-va-ya ma-SHI-na"}, {"id": "d2s13", "word": null, "ru": "Ма́ленькие коты́ до́ма.", "mk": "{Ма́леньк|ие} {кот|ы́} до́ма.", "g": "pl", "case": "Nominative", "en": "The little cats are at home.", "pics": ["cat.png", "house.png"], "audio": "3616ca5131.mp3", "pr": "MA-lin'-ki-ye ka-TIH DO-ma"}, {"id": "d2s14", "word": null, "ru": "У меня́ нет большо́го до́ма.", "mk": "У меня́ нет {больш|о́го} {до́м|а}.", "g": "m", "case": "Genitive", "en": "I don't have a big house.", "pics": ["house.png", "cross_mark.png"], "audio": "1832e5dca4.mp3", "pr": "u mi-NYA nyet bal'-SHO-va DO-ma"}, {"id": "d2s15", "word": null, "ru": "Э́то кни́га мое́й сестры́.", "mk": "Э́то кни́га {мо|е́й} {сестр|ы́}.", "g": "f", "case": "Genitive", "en": "This is my sister's book.", "pics": ["girl.png", "closed_book.png"], "audio": "eefe86cc71.mp3", "pr": "E-ta KNI-ga ma-YEI sist-RIH"}, {"id": "d2s16", "word": null, "ru": "У меня́ мно́го хоро́ших друзе́й.", "mk": "У меня́ мно́го {хоро́ш|их} {друз|е́й}.", "g": "pl", "case": "Genitive", "en": "I have many good friends.", "pics": ["people_hugging.png", "party_popper.png"], "audio": "06bdf50bca.mp3", "pr": "u mi-NYA MNO-ga kha-RO-shikh dru-ZYEI"}, {"id": "d2s17", "word": null, "ru": "Я звоню́ хоро́шему дру́гу.", "mk": "Я звоню́ {хоро́ш|ему} {дру́г|у}.", "g": "m", "case": "Dative", "en": "I'm calling a good friend.", "pics": ["mobile_phone.png", "people_hugging.png"], "audio": "e7f2b0d9fa.mp3", "pr": "ya zva-NYU kha-RO-she-mu DRU-gu"}, {"id": "d2s18", "word": null, "ru": "Я пишу́ мое́й сестре́.", "mk": "Я пишу́ {мо|е́й} {сестр|е́}.", "g": "f", "case": "Dative", "en": "I'm writing to my sister.", "pics": ["writing_hand.png", "girl.png"], "audio": "b29cf97b39.mp3", "pr": "ya pi-SHU ma-YEI sist-RYE"}, {"id": "d2s19", "word": null, "ru": "Я звоню́ но́вым друзья́м.", "mk": "Я звоню́ {но́в|ым} {друзь|я́м}.", "g": "pl", "case": "Dative", "en": "I'm calling new friends.", "pics": ["telephone_receiver.png", "people_hugging.png"], "audio": "0186e99e35.mp3", "pr": "ya zva-NYU NO-vihm dru-ZYAM"}, {"id": "d2s20", "word": null, "ru": "Я ви́жу ма́ленького кота́.", "mk": "Я ви́жу {ма́леньк|ого} {кот|а́}.", "g": "m", "case": "Accusative", "en": "I see a little cat.", "pics": ["eyes.png", "cat.png"], "audio": "d08a3422b3.mp3", "pr": "ya VI-zhu MA-lin'-ka-va ka-TA"}, {"id": "d2s21", "word": null, "ru": "Я чита́ю но́вую кни́гу.", "mk": "Я чита́ю {но́в|ую} {кни́г|у}.", "g": "f", "case": "Accusative", "en": "I'm reading a new book.", "pics": ["open_book.png", "sparkles.png"], "audio": "af09ac3f23.mp3", "pr": "ya chi-TA-yu NO-vu-yu KNI-gu"}, {"id": "d2s22", "word": null, "ru": "Мы смо́трим но́вые фи́льмы.", "mk": "Мы смо́трим {но́в|ые} {фи́льм|ы}.", "g": "pl", "case": "Accusative", "en": "We watch new films.", "pics": ["television.png", "popcorn.png"], "audio": "7b25d9a7af.mp3", "pr": "mih SMOT-rim NO-vih-ye FIL'-mih"}, {"id": "d2s23", "word": null, "ru": "Я игра́ю с ма́леньким бра́том.", "mk": "Я игра́ю с {ма́леньк|им} {бра́т|ом}.", "g": "m", "case": "Instrumental", "en": "I'm playing with my little brother.", "pics": ["boy.png", "soccer_ball.png"], "audio": "7feaab3317.mp3", "pr": "ya ig-RA-yu s MA-lin'-kim BRA-tam"}, {"id": "d2s24", "word": null, "ru": "Я чита́ю с ма́ленькой сестро́й.", "mk": "Я чита́ю с {ма́леньк|ой} {сестр|о́й}.", "g": "f", "case": "Instrumental", "en": "I'm reading with my little sister.", "pics": ["girl.png", "open_book.png"], "audio": "1345aa8735.mp3", "pr": "ya chi-TA-yu s MA-lin'-kai sist-ROI"}, {"id": "d2s25", "word": null, "ru": "Мы игра́ем с хоро́шими друзья́ми.", "mk": "Мы игра́ем с {хоро́ш|ими} {друзь|я́ми}.", "g": "pl", "case": "Instrumental", "en": "We play with good friends.", "pics": ["people_hugging.png", "volleyball.png"], "audio": "c256ab4bd6.mp3", "pr": "mih ig-RA-yem s kha-RO-shi-mi dru-ZYA-mi"}, {"id": "d2s26", "word": null, "ru": "Я ду́маю о но́вом го́роде.", "mk": "Я ду́маю о {но́в|ом} {го́род|е}.", "g": "m", "case": "Prepositional", "en": "I'm thinking about the new city.", "pics": ["thinking_face.png", "cityscape.png"], "audio": "c2bdb99340.mp3", "pr": "ya DU-ma-yu a NO-vam GO-ra-dye"}, {"id": "d2s27", "word": null, "ru": "Кни́га в но́вой маши́не.", "mk": "Кни́га в {но́в|ой} {маши́н|е}.", "g": "f", "case": "Prepositional", "en": "The book is in the new car.", "pics": ["closed_book.png", "automobile.png"], "audio": "9a1716c7ed.mp3", "pr": "KNI-ga v NO-vai ma-SHI-nye"}, {"id": "d2s28", "word": null, "ru": "Мы говори́м о хоро́ших кни́гах.", "mk": "Мы говори́м о {хоро́ш|их} {кни́г|ах}.", "g": "pl", "case": "Prepositional", "en": "We're talking about good books.", "pics": ["speech_balloon.png", "books.png"], "audio": "166b754ce9.mp3", "pr": "mih ga-va-RIM a kha-RO-shikh KNI-gakh"}], "notes": [{"h": "Gender from the last letter", "lines": ["Masculine: consonant or -й (брат, кот, дом).", "Feminine: -а / -я (сестра́, маши́на).", "Neuter: -о / -е (окно́, письмо́), also -мя (вре́мя).", "-ь can be either: день (m), ночь (f). Male people in -а are masculine (па́па)."]}, {"h": "When each case is used", "lines": ["Имени́тельный (Nominative) — кто? что? The subject: who or what does the action. This is the dictionary form.", "Роди́тельный (Genitive) — кого́? чего́? “of”, owning something, “there is no…” (нет), after у, из, без and numbers.", "Да́тельный (Dative) — кому́? чему́? “to / for” someone: the person who receives, who you call, write or give to.", "Вини́тельный (Accusative) — кого́? что? The direct object: what you see, read, drink. Also в / на + where you are going.", "Твори́тельный (Instrumental) — кем? чем? “with” (с), or the tool you do something with.", "Предло́жный (Prepositional) — о ком? о чём? где? “about” (о), and location with в / на (in, on, at)."]}, {"h": "Adjectives", "lines": ["Adjectives have their own endings but follow the noun's gender, number and case.", "Neuter = masculine except nom./acc. -ое. Plural is the same for all genders.", "Feminine is -ой in 4 of 6 cases; accusative -ую (но́вую кни́гу)."]}], "tables": [{"title": "Noun endings", "cols": ["case", "masc. кот", "fem. маши́на", "neut. окно́", "plural"], "rows": [["Nominative", "кот", "маши́на", "окно́", "коты́ · маши́ны · о́кна"], ["Genitive", "кота́", "маши́ны", "окна́", "кото́в · маши́н · о́кон"], ["Dative", "коту́", "маши́не", "окну́", "кота́м · маши́нам · о́кнам"], ["Accusative", "кота́*", "маши́ну", "окно́", "кото́в* · маши́ны · о́кна"], ["Instrumental", "кото́м", "маши́ной", "окно́м", "кота́ми · маши́нами · о́кнами"], ["Prepositional", "(о) коте́", "(о) маши́не", "(об) окне́", "(о) кота́х · маши́нах · о́кнах"]]}, {"title": "Adjective endings (но́вый)", "cols": ["case", "masc.", "fem.", "neut.", "plural"], "rows": [["Nominative", "но́вый", "но́вая", "но́вое", "но́вые"], ["Genitive", "но́вого", "но́вой", "но́вого", "но́вых"], ["Dative", "но́вому", "но́вой", "но́вому", "но́вым"], ["Accusative", "но́вый / но́вого*", "но́вую", "но́вое", "но́вые / но́вых*"], ["Instrumental", "но́вым", "но́вой", "но́вым", "но́выми"], ["Prepositional", "(о) но́вом", "(о) но́вой", "(о) но́вом", "(о) но́вых"]]}], "video": "videos/day2.mp4"}